      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Your example would be solved by the exposure of Dictionary<T,T>. \nSetProgramVariable is already dangerous enough (can break type safety rules, can override consts, etc). We'd gain much more value if we had more basic types exposed, rather than trying to introduce workarounds.",
