  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-21T06:28:39.494Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Program variables currently cannot be set via SetProgramVariable unless the variable was previously declared as a public variable at compile time.\nIt would be great if variables could be arbitrarily created and set with SetProgramVariable at run-time to provide more scripting control and enable user-defined scripted variables to interoperate correctly with Udon's APIs.\n\nSee attached image for an example use case.",
